{
  "id": 1162,
  "name": "rusted-shield",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "species-specific",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/18/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "おおむかしの　えいゆうが　さいやくを\nうちはらったと　つたえられる　たて　だが\nいまは　さびて　ボロボロに　なっている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "먼 옛날의 영웅이 재앙을 막는 데\n사용했다고 전해지는 방패지만\n지금은 녹이 슬고 닳아버렸다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "據說在很久以前，英雄就是\n用這面盾來擊退災厄。\n但現在已經生鏽，變得破爛不堪。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "On raconte que ce bouclier fut jadis utilisé\npar un héros pour vaincre une calamité.\nÀ présent, il est tout usé et rouillé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mit diesem Schild soll ein Held einstmals großes Unheil\nabgewendet haben. Rost sowie der Zahn der Zeit haben\njedoch ihre Spuren hinterlassen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuenta una antigua leyenda que un valiente héroe\nasió este escudo para hacer frente a un cataclismo,\npero ahora está oxidado y en un estado lamentable.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si racconta che in passato un eroe riuscì a respingere\nla calamità servendosi di questo scudo. Ora è tutto\narrugginito e rovinato.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It is said that a hero used this shield to halt a terrible\ndisaster in ancient times. But it’s grown rusty and worn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "大昔の　英雄が　災厄を\n討ち払ったと　伝えられる　盾　だが\nいまは　さびて　ボロボロに　なっている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "据说很久以前，英雄就是\n拿着这面盾驱走了灾厄。\n而现在早已变得锈迹斑斑。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuenta una antigua leyenda que un valiente héroe\nasió este escudo para hacer frente a un cataclismo,\npero ahora está oxidado y en un estado lamentable.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
